      "side": 1,
      "message": "This flag was added in 8a924db2d7b5eb69 (\"fs: Pass AT_GETATTR_NOSEC flag to getattr interface function\") to prevent unnecessary calls to security_inode_getattr, which also avoids a potential null pointer in IMA with overlayfs.\n\nInstead of just dropping the flag, we should call the nosec variant of vfs_getattr if that flag is present.\n\nOverlayfs deals with this by using a helper function for vfs_getattr:\n```\nstatic inline int ovl_do_getattr(const struct path *path, struct kstat *stat,\n\t\t\t\t u32 request_mask, unsigned int flags)\n{\n\tif (flags \u0026 AT_GETATTR_NOSEC)\n\t\treturn vfs_getattr_nosec(path, stat, request_mask, flags);\n\treturn vfs_getattr(path, stat, request_mask, flags);\n}\n```",
